Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.43,0:00:06.49,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去寻找吧 收集起梦的碎片{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.47,0:00:17.64,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使胸中苦闷 去感受真切的现在吧{\fad(0,400)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.45,0:00:22.51,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比外表更单纯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.29,0:00:26.02,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是却无法传达
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.96,0:00:33.62,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要说的话 总是藏在口袋里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.23,0:00:40.26,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,充满孩子气的话语 如今已无法开口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.74,0:00:47.97,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽说时间会冲淡一切 我们却无法相互理解
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.44,0:00:54.40,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,24小时 一直相信着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.55,0:00:58.14,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.22,0:01:02.68,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使只是俗常的话语
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.19,0:01:09.15,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间总是 微笑着匆匆流逝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.33,0:01:20.44,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起回忆 还是去追求理想的今天{\fad(0,1025)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.08,0:01:38.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好悠闲呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.78,0:01:41.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的 之前的战斗仿佛假的一样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.49,0:01:45.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是四魂碎片的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.25,0:01:46.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.92,0:01:48.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且正在接近中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.43,0:01:54.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.26,0:01:55.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.77,0:01:58.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我嗅到戈薇的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.70,0:02:00.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,特地来见你的 过的还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.60,0:02:03.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有何指教 瘦皮狼？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.57,0:02:06.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 不可以一见面就打架喔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.08,0:02:10.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少罗唆 要不是这种情形… 我马上宰了你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.08,0:02:13.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是一点都没变 烂狗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.42,0:02:16.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每次看到你都 紧张兮兮叽叽呱呱的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.49,0:02:19.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 跟这种人在一起不累吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.62,0:02:21.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等… 喂 钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.66,0:02:22.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别扯一些没礼貌的话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.39,0:02:26.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,“犬夜叉只是觉得 戈薇会被抢走而焦急”
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.16,0:02:29.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你老是这么想 就大错特错了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.80,0:02:30.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.13,0:02:34.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 别跟着起哄
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.70,0:02:36.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真是一刻都不得闲呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.91,0:02:43.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第46话 兽郎丸与影郎丸
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.41,0:02:47.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉你奈落城的所在位置？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.72,0:02:48.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是白痴啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.95,0:02:51.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道的话我们就不会这么累了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.42,0:02:52.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来你不知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.16,0:02:56.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落那家伙 在城的周围布满了结界
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.53,0:02:59.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为同伴报仇的事就交给我们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.06,0:03:03.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只要把双脚的 四魂之玉碎片交出来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.30,0:03:07.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后再乖乖躲回 巢穴里发抖就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.01,0:03:11.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦 烂狗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.57,0:03:13.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你挥刀意外的迟钝呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.91,0:03:14.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.78,0:03:16.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙还是很重吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.15,0:03:19.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然 怎么可能突然变轻呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.02,0:03:21.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有种就别跑
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.18,0:03:22.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不巧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.85,0:03:25.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可没空在这跟烂狗吵
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.35,0:03:28.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 给我站住
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.79,0:03:30.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大烂狗 在我杀了奈落之前
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.36,0:03:32.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇就先让你保管
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.20,0:03:34.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你敢动她 我就要你好看
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.80,0:03:39.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙连逃走的时候 都自信满满呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.94,0:03:41.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了啦 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.50,0:03:43.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用不着发那么大的脾气嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.57,0:03:46.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我什么时候发脾气啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.81,0:03:52.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我很高兴他为我吃醋
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.71,0:03:54.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但就不能用温柔点的方式吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.22,0:03:57.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是有够累人的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.19,0:04:02.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟…跟我在一起真的那么累吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.23,0:04:07.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在沮丧什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.20,0:04:10.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用不着在意钢牙说的话吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.73,0:04:13.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实他是在意戈薇小姐说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.81,0:04:22.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.45,0:04:26.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虫？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.32,0:04:30.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢 钢牙？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.59,0:04:33.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这个味道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.82,0:04:36.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟神乐一样…绝对没错
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.85,0:04:58.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖狼族的少主…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.28,0:05:02.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想不到你比犬夜叉 早一步闻到我的气味
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.42,0:05:05.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙…是奈落吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.62,0:05:09.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟那个叫神乐的女人 相同的气味
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.63,0:05:11.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙就是奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.13,0:05:14.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我永远忘不了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.86,0:05:16.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,同伴被你杀害的仇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.57,0:05:19.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天我要在这讨回来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.64,0:05:26.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难得来了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.01,0:05:30.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就当作我新的分身的饵食吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.88,0:05:34.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笼子？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.15,0:05:37.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哼 我是不知道你载着什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.95,0:05:39.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这里撞见我是你气数已尽
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.96,0:05:42.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要报我同伴的仇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.53,0:05:45.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.53,0:05:47.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的对手是这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.10,0:05:49.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出来吧 兽郎丸
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.05,0:06:08.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这小子怎么搞的…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.55,0:06:10.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哼 刚刚好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.19,0:06:12.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我先收拾这小子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.85,0:06:14.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后再将你们通通解决掉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.56,0:06:16.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦 奈落！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.13,0:06:19.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快拿掉这小子的辔头跟锁链
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.53,0:06:22.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对付你这样就够了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.90,0:06:27.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么…我就不客气了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.40,0:06:31.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接招吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.31,0:06:38.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.55,0:06:46.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这小子动作真快
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.62,0:06:47.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使受限制了还是比我…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.32,0:06:49.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 更重要的是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.82,0:06:51.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这股寒气是怎么搞的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.43,0:06:55.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这小子的辔头里…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.63,0:06:59.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是奈落的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.07,0:07:01.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等啊 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.00,0:07:03.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要单独行动
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.94,0:07:04.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.84,0:07:07.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你明明就还不能 好好的使用铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.71,0:07:08.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗唆
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.64,0:07:10.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不只是奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.51,0:07:14.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有恶心的钢牙那家伙的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.78,0:07:16.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要收拾奈落的人是我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.85,0:07:19.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可以让钢牙抢先
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.35,0:07:21.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.15,0:07:24.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在搞什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.79,0:07:26.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少罗唆 我现在忙得很
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.86,0:07:27.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.73,0:07:31.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然能追上我的脚步
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.30,0:07:41.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙 原来你在逃跑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.54,0:07:43.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.81,0:07:49.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你终于来了 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.12,0:07:53.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.39,0:07:55.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.55,0:07:59.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙仇也不报就逃走了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.69,0:08:02.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比我想象中要识相多了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.26,0:08:07.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别拿我跟那个 胆小鬼瘦皮狼相提并论
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.83,0:08:10.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…新的奈落分身吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.34,0:08:14.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兽郎丸 我就解开你的封印
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.47,0:08:16.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你放手一搏吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.32,0:08:32.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙到底是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.96,0:08:38.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解开辔头的兽郎丸谁都挡不住
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.60,0:08:41.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到把这里所有人杀光为止
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.41,0:08:52.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么搞的 这个叫兽郎丸的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.88,0:08:54.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阴阳怪气的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.11,0:08:57.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总归是奈落的傀儡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.28,0:09:00.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是却打掉了 应该是自己人的奈落的脑袋
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.12,0:09:02.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙敌我不分吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.59,0:09:05.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以才被辔头与锁链封印了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.79,0:09:11.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.50,0:09:15.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这小子怎么搞的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.10,0:09:17.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么轻易就被打中
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.14,0:09:19.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是陷阱吗？不…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.37,0:09:21.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这小子怎么看都不像是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.64,0:09:24.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会卖弄小聪明战斗的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.31,0:09:26.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然这样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.95,0:09:28.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就一口气解决掉你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.15,0:09:32.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散魂铁爪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.82,0:09:35.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不相上下？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.39,0:09:40.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.29,0:09:44.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.90,0:09:46.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手腕变长了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.56,0:09:48.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙的身体能变化吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.77,0:09:57.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到奈落了？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.64,0:09:58.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你怎么回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.41,0:10:00.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该不会是逃回来的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.58,0:10:01.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哼 是直觉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.28,0:10:03.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姑且不论奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.55,0:10:06.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他带的那个头怪怪的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.58,0:10:08.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散发出非常危险的气息
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.82,0:10:10.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的直觉绝对不会错的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.82,0:10:12.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 凭这一点就知道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.42,0:10:14.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉真是个大傻瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.06,0:10:17.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这时候他肯定是 被兽郎丸打得哭爹喊娘啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.96,0:10:19.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还遇到犬夜叉呀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.83,0:10:20.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.43,0:10:23.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个 钢牙…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.00,0:10:25.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许是我们多嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.34,0:10:30.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和犬夜叉在一起的戈薇大姐 不是也危险了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.68,0:10:35.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混帐东西 为什么不早说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.58,0:10:38.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该自己发觉到嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.22,0:10:46.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个浑蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.36,0:10:48.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.09,0:10:50.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,砍断手腕了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.76,0:10:51.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.36,0:10:53.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全没有砍到的触感
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.60,0:10:57.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像是自行从兽狼丸身上分离
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.14,0:11:07.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手腕又接上去了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.98,0:11:08.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然没错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.35,0:11:11.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才那个根本不是手腕
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.12,0:11:16.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么…从地面？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.72,0:11:17.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.50,0:11:25.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.87,0:11:29.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那小子的内脏
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.73,0:11:32.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,味道真是不错 兽郎丸
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.57,0:11:35.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶…居然还有一只
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.51,0:11:38.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.01,0:11:42.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是影郎丸
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.08,0:11:46.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我沉睡在兽郎丸的肚子里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.29,0:11:50.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在兽郎丸的肚子里…那么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.39,0:11:52.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那辔头是为了封印你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.39,0:11:57.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为兽郎丸只服从我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.03,0:12:00.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使对像是奈落也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.60,0:12:01.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.60,0:12:05.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 剩下的人也处理掉吧 兽郎丸
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.20,0:12:06.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽情的吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.91,0:12:08.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风穴
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.54,0:12:11.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.18,0:12:15.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.79,0:12:21.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.56,0:12:26.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风穴
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.50,0:12:33.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在吸哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.63,0:12:35.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上面吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.63,0:12:36.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太慢了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.07,0:12:39.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凭这种速度也想打倒我们吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.74,0:12:42.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.31,0:12:45.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.58,0:12:51.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒 没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.32,0:12:56.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的刀比较恐怖
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.85,0:12:59.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你就躲到被窝里睡觉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.16,0:13:01.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.46,0:13:04.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你还不能乱动啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.50,0:13:06.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肚子已经开了个洞啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.60,0:13:08.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少罗唆 这只是家常便饭
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.47,0:13:15.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这女人的命 我要了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.98,0:13:19.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.12,0:13:26.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.43,0:13:37.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.74,0:13:38.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.40,0:13:41.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大烂狗 你在干嘛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.04,0:13:44.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然让戈薇遭受这种危险
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.18,0:13:45.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.68,0:13:47.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你明明就夹着尾巴逃掉还敢说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.05,0:13:51.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是只有这次 才跟你道谢 大混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.75,0:13:55.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道我刚才的处境十分危险
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.12,0:13:56.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.64,0:13:58.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.74,0:14:00.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那只怪模怪样的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.11,0:14:03.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从兽郎丸的肚子里跑出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.65,0:14:05.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怪不得
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.28,0:14:07.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从兽郎丸身上感受到的寒气
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.65,0:14:10.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这家伙的关系吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.82,0:14:12.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个叫影郎丸的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.02,0:14:15.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,动作快到我们追不上
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.22,0:14:17.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们以为我是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.39,0:14:21.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本就没有能 从我脚底下逃走的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.53,0:14:24.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有嘴巴厉害而已
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.10,0:14:28.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很敢说嘛！我要把你捏碎！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.91,0:14:34.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连嘴皮子也不怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.68,0:14:36.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的速度不过如此吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.71,0:14:37.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.85,0:14:42.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兽郎丸 你的对手是本大爷
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.46,0:14:48.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.82,0:14:51.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别丢人现眼了 烂狗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.83,0:14:54.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连那只笨妖怪都束手无策吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.73,0:14:57.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么！这浑蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.34,0:15:03.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你才是连影郎丸都抓不到
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.51,0:15:05.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别拿我和你相提并论
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.94,0:15:11.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,渐渐看得见了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.68,0:15:16.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.12,0:15:18.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他抢在影郎丸的前面了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.92,0:15:20.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.23,0:15:25.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你死！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.93,0:15:27.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打中了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.40,0:15:31.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.47,0:15:32.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又逃掉了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.51,0:15:39.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么…从土里？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.38,0:15:46.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.65,0:15:51.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 又潜下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.82,0:15:57.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好！脚被封住就没有胜算了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.19,0:16:00.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉还倒在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.33,0:16:06.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多该吃那女人的内脏了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.74,0:16:09.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.57,0:16:12.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,影郎丸 你敢碰戈薇…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.07,0:16:14.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要把你连骨头都吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.91,0:16:19.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你休想
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.92,0:16:22.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来不及了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.22,0:16:30.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.69,0:16:31.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.73,0:16:36.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉…是刀变轻了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.06,0:16:39.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他用单手挥动铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.60,0:16:40.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他头脑简单
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.27,0:16:43.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概脑袋被冲昏 忘记重量了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.54,0:16:46.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁头脑简单啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.21,0:16:47.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被听到了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.81,0:16:49.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又潜下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.28,0:16:51.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.95,0:16:54.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 你不要紧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.28,0:16:56.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉才是 好严重的伤…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.05,0:16:59.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,烂狗 你还活着啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.45,0:17:01.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙的脚也中招了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.26,0:17:04.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那小子一点用都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.46,0:17:06.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚开吧 瘦皮狼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.96,0:17:09.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我把兽郎丸砍成两…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.63,0:17:11.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又变重了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.10,0:17:14.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然刚才是因为 一心要保护戈薇才会…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.94,0:17:17.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只会在旁边吠的胆小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.74,0:17:20.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么…吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.84,0:17:22.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顺便连你也一起砍
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.48,0:17:29.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.85,0:17:33.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看招
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.32,0:17:37.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不会道谢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.06,0:17:39.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就说声谢嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.30,0:17:45.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,战斗再拖下去的话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.57,0:17:46.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使是犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.63,0:17:47.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身体也会撑不下去的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.07,0:17:51.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不知道潜入地底的 影郎丸会从哪里袭击
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.31,0:17:52.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.27,0:17:55.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是至少能封住 土里的影郎丸的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.31,0:17:57.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 锡杖借一下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.58,0:17:59.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么策略吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.58,0:18:04.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种毒…虽然效果不长
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.29,0:18:06.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要逼出影郎丸应该够了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.79,0:18:15.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,土变红了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.37,0:18:21.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.54,0:18:22.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点抓住影郎丸
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.10,0:18:25.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,土里的毒应该会让他动作变慢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.84,0:18:28.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.61,0:18:30.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.92,0:18:39.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没出息的烂狗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.62,0:18:40.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下爬不起来了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.56,0:18:44.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉！你振作点
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.93,0:18:46.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别慌张 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.36,0:18:47.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来我一个人就够了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.06,0:18:48.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.53,0:18:51.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要没有碍手碍脚的影郎丸
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.40,0:18:54.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一只白痴妖怪是轻而易举
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.87,0:18:57.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只剩这一只就一口气打倒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.88,0:19:02.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,影郎丸的气息消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.91,0:19:04.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是潜到暗处了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.05,0:19:07.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.38,0:19:12.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋！钢牙 快回来！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.05,0:19:14.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,烂狗就躲起来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.66,0:19:17.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你的身体…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.66,0:19:19.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让开 钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.16,0:19:24.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不让开的话 我就连你一起砍成两半
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.27,0:19:27.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得手了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.44,0:19:28.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.34,0:19:32.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在才发现太迟了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.27,0:19:33.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你少罗唆
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.69,0:19:50.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,粉身碎骨了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.69,0:19:52.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.59,0:19:54.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.86,0:19:56.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 害我花了那么多功夫
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.67,0:19:58.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这浑蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.87,0:20:00.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是打算连我一起宰了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.80,0:20:03.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你果然是这么想
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.67,0:20:04.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁知道
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.71,0:20:05.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 我要宰了你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.97,0:20:07.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等 等一下嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.71,0:20:09.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你完全没有半点犹豫
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.44,0:20:11.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就狠狠的一刀劈过来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.45,0:20:12.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是因为他认为
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.28,0:20:15.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以钢牙的速度一定能够避开
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.88,0:20:16.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对吧 犬夜叉？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.52,0:20:19.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,受不了 罗唆的瘦皮狼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.02,0:20:24.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你再发牢骚我就真的劈下去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.49,0:20:26.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好笑 有本事就来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.96,0:20:28.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个没死透的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.53,0:20:29.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.66,0:20:31.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.50,0:20:35.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙 今天就先离开好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.97,0:20:37.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做什么啊 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.71,0:20:39.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你明明受了重伤吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.97,0:20:42.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有想过再打下去 会有什么后果吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.24,0:20:45.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙 今天真的很感激
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.48,0:20:47.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多亏你帮了大忙 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.22,0:20:51.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不认为这样 钢牙就会乖乖回去…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.55,0:20:52.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.52,0:20:55.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是我的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.56,0:20:59.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么能放心把你 交给那一无是处的烂狗呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.99,0:21:02.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 居然让他胡言乱语
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.86,0:21:04.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当你有危险的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.27,0:21:06.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定会来救你的 再见了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.30,0:21:09.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.04,0:21:12.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我站住 臭家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.44,0:21:13.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.74,0:21:17.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你又把钢牙放走了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.55,0:21:20.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为 犬夜叉的身体…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.75,0:21:23.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我会输给那只瘦皮狼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.49,0:21:29.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之先治疗伤口吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.36,0:21:30.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说过不用了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.23,0:21:33.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且刚才那什么态度啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.86,0:21:36.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了讨好那家伙还向他谄媚
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.30,0:21:40.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是丢人现眼 让人看不下去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.57,0:21:41.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正你啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.97,0:21:46.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那 那什么眼神啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.07,0:21:48.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.61,0:21:51.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要回家去啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.75,0:21:53.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回去啊 我才不会拦你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.78,0:21:57.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唉…话说完了就走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.22,0:21:59.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还要好好帮法师疗伤呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.59,0:22:05.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看这样子 真是长不大呀
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.54,0:22:29.45,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,何不把真正重要的事物以外{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.72,0:22:41.23,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全部 都舍弃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.93,0:22:48.59,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现实 往往是如此残酷
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.34,0:22:52.07,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但每当 遇到这种时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.14,0:22:56.80,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只要紧闭双眼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.85,0:23:03.45,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,便能看见 你的笑容{\fad(0,900)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.36,0:23:11.22,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Ah- 但愿从此以往
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.83,0:23:18.76,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到进入 沉眠的那一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.34,0:23:26.20,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的 那抹笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.81,0:23:34.28,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都绝没有 消逝的瞬间{\fad(0,900)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.94,0:23:48.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五十年前设下陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.98,0:23:51.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让犬夜叉和桔梗 自相残杀的奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.41,0:23:53.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在又布下了天罗地网 要除掉桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.15,0:23:57.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己体内残留的 鬼蜘蛛的心仰慕着桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.62,0:23:59.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他似乎很痛恨这一点
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.72,0:24:00.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗的危机
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.99,0:24:02.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉不可能置之不理
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.22,0:24:04.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是为什么 犬夜叉？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.96,0:24:07.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为何与桔梗那样抱在一起…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.63,0:24:10.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.23,0:24:12.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落残留的鬼蜘蛛灵魂
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.40,0:24:13.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敬请期待
